Subject: [PATCH] panel-list: Assistant button among the input devices

Plinius: the assistant button panel goes next to Mouse & Touchpad and
Keyboard instead of after Power.
---
 shell/cc-panel-list.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/shell/cc-panel-list.c b/shell/cc-panel-list.c
index 1930db158..198c7a14d 100644
--- a/shell/cc-panel-list.c
+++ b/shell/cc-panel-list.c
@@ -347,7 +347,6 @@ static const gchar *const panel_order[] = {
     "display",
     "sound",
     "power",
-    "assistant",
     "multitasking",
     "background",
 
@@ -364,6 +363,7 @@ static const gchar *const panel_order[] = {
 
     "mouse",
     "keyboard",
+    "assistant",
     "color",
     "printers",
     "wacom",
